al and collect as a team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc8 <strong>Touchdown</strong> \u2013 Carry the crystal to the end zone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Classic Battle</strong> \u2013 Mayhem in its purest form</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Practice Stages</strong> \u2013 Hone your skills in 3 special maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/f1989cde3fdd5461c3604bbf36d09ca3.poster.avif?t=1754412558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/f1989cde3fdd5461c3604bbf36d09ca3.webm?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/f1989cde3fdd5461c3604bbf36d09ca3.mp4?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Grand Cups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the heart of the competition in the Grand Cups, a multi-stage challenge to earn trophies and climb to the top. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/5251546d9b208a78f6e375b760aa28c0.poster.avif?t=1754412558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/5251546d9b208a78f6e375b760aa28c0.webm?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/5251546d9b208a78f6e375b760aa28c0.mp4?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Power-Up Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up one item in each hand and make your move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Blast, block, and bounce your way to victory with tools that reward timing and creativity - from rolling beetles to tricky traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/ed66ee9c067ea18986757893cd787a02.poster.avif?t=1754412558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/ed66ee9c067ea18986757893cd787a02.webm?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/ed66ee9c067ea18986757893cd787a02.mp4?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Move Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, drive, or fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hop into karts, buses, jetpacks, or flying devices to chase shortcuts and surprise your rivals. And  give your teammate a lift\u2026 or catch one yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/0148ffd280e680837584045abde3ac50.poster.avif?t=1754412558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/0148ffd280e680837584045abde3ac50.webm?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/0148ffd280e680837584045abde3ac50.mp4?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Extra</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect XP to unlock new stages, climb the leaderboard, and discover 12 fully-voiced characters, each with multiple skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Split Screen &amp; Online Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring the fun to the couch or the world stage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to <strong>12-player matches</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split screen</strong> for up to 4 players (even online!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage voting, team selection, and plenty of laughs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great for family nights, parties, or friendly rivalries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/b7b5764621457c3147b0dd2184d11a22.poster.avif?t=1754412558\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/b7b5764621457c3147b0dd2184d11a22.webm?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1375650/extras/b7b5764621457c3147b0dd2184d11a22.mp4?t=1754412558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
